# An object refers to its ρ, which it does not declare.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ b ↦ ξ.ρ ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a.b ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 a foo
F c1 b
D c2 c1 ρ
P c1 b c2
P c0 a c1
D c3 c0 a
D c4 c3 b
P c0 foo c4
